Cell["\<\
If parameters are not specified, the parameters in model[\"params\"] are used.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1034567890,ExpressionUUID->"a7b8c9d0-e1f2-3456-7890-123456789abc"],

Cell[TextData[{
